                <pb facs="0895" n="799" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg799"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Loomis to the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Caracas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-10-14"><hi rendition="#italic">October 14,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Have been informed by Venezuelan minister for foreign affairs general commanding
                    army of Venezuela deserted, and President of Venezuela will be forced to abandon
                    Caracas without fighting. He may establish his government at Maracaibo or Puerto
                    Cabello.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Loomis.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
